      "output": "[\"PHARMA5\",\"SAVE20\"]",
      "explanation": "First coupon is valid.\n\tSecond coupon has empty code (invalid).\n\tThird coupon is valid.\n\tFourth coupon has special character @ (invalid)."
    },
